# Pairs with CausalOrder. The shipper's durable cursor advances on send rather than on the receiver's
# acknowledgement, so the watermark vouches for an entry the receiver has not applied.
MODULE: CausalOrderShipAcksBeforeReceipt
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the shipper acknowledges an entry as it sends it, so S passes a write the receiver never ran
PERTURBS: ShipA
BOUNDS: Parts = {1}

--- FIND
    /\ adr' = [adr EXCEPT ![p] = @ + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED Origin /\ UNCHANGED <<aack, bdeps, back, losses>> /\ UNCHANGED Rcv
--- REPLACE
    /\ adr' = [adr EXCEPT ![p] = @ + 1]
    \* MUTATION: acknowledged on send.
    /\ aack' = [aack EXCEPT ![p] = @ + 1]
    /\ UNCHANGED Origin /\ UNCHANGED <<bdeps, back, losses>> /\ UNCHANGED Rcv
--- END
